# welcome-fit-menu-pick-theme-768x1024 (fix-fit-menu): the gear clicked at
# its zoomed centre (740, 23) in a 768 x 1024 window, then the "Tron Cyan"
# theme row at its drawn centre (599, 227). The shot: the page in Tron Cyan,
# the row checked. The behaviour: the theme line reads tron-cyan, as the
# reference's reads.
route welcome
size 768 1024
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
click 740 23
wait 500
click 599 227
wait 500
shot welcome-fit-menu-pick-theme-768x1024
